# 🗄 Database Design

This project will use a SQL database such as **PostgreSQL** or **MySQL** to store application data.

The database is designed to support:

* Treatment service management
* Customer bookings
* Customer enquiries
* Payment records
* Admin authentication
* Image storage references

---

# 🧱 Database Tables Overview

```txt
Database
 ┣ admins
 ┣ services
 ┣ service_images
 ┣ bookings
 ┣ enquiries
 ┣ payments
 ┗ website_contents
```

---

# 1️⃣ Admins Table

Stores administrator account information for backend login.

```txt
admins
```

| Field         | Type           | Description          |
| ------------- | -------------- | -------------------- |
| id            | Integer / UUID | Primary key          |
| name          | String         | Admin name           |
| email         | String         | Admin login email    |
| password_hash | String         | Encrypted password   |
| role          | String         | Admin role           |
| created_at    | DateTime       | Account created date |
| updated_at    | DateTime       | Last updated date    |

