# 🔗 Entity Relationship Summary

```txt
services
   ├── service_images
   └── bookings
          └── payments

admins
   └── manage services / bookings / enquiries

enquiries
   └── customer consultation records

website_contents
   └── editable website content
```

---

# 📌 Database Design Objective

The database is designed to:

* Store treatment service information
* Manage customer booking records
* Track enquiry submissions
* Support deposit payment records
* Enable admin content management
* Support future CRM and membership expansion

